@startuml
!include ../theme.puml
title 五维专业适配、受控条件与结果快照模型
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "JD匹配方案版本\nJdMatchPlanVersion" as Plan {
  jdVersionId
  versionNo
  status: DRAFT/ACTIVE/SUPERSEDED
  configuredByUserId
}
class "五维权重版本\nWeightProfileVersion" as Weight {
  ownerUserId
  skills/role/years
  responsibility/industryProject
}
class "官方条件方案版本\nControlledCriterionPlanVersion" as Criteria {
  versionNo
  planMaxBonusPoints <= 30
  configuredByUserId
}
class "受控条件定义\nControlledCriterionDefinition" as Criterion {
  code: AGE/GENDER/EDUCATION/
  CERTIFICATE/LANGUAGE
  level: MUST/PREFER/DISPLAY_ONLY
  operator/expectedValue
  bonusPoints: 5/10/20
}
class "个人偏好选择版本\nPersonalPreferSelectionVersion" as Selection {
  ownerUserId
  selectedPreferIds
}
class "固定基础评价\nBaseEvaluationSnapshot" as Evaluation {
  resumeFactSnapshotId
  jdParseSnapshotId
  fiveDimensionScores
  evidenceCoverage
  reliabilityLevel
}
class "条件评价\nCriterionEvaluation" as CriterionResult {
  status: SATISFIED/UNKNOWN/
  NOT_SATISFIED
  actualValue/evidenceRefs
}
class "派生匹配结果\nWeightedMatchResult" as Weighted {
  baseScore: 0..100
  bonusScore/planMaxBonusPoints
  selectedMaxBonusPoints
  compositeReferenceScore
  mustTier/sortMode
}
class "亮点/风险/未知\nMatchFlag" as Flag {
  type
  severity
  reviewStatus
}
class "AI运行记录\nAiRun" as AiRun {
  provider/model/promptVersion
  inputHash/tokens/cost
}
class "HR复核\nEvaluationReview" as Review {
  action/reason/reviewerId
}

Plan "1" -- "1" Criteria
Criteria "1" -- "1..*" Criterion
Criteria "1" -- "0..*" Selection
Evaluation "1" -- "0..*" CriterionResult
Criterion "1" -- "0..*" CriterionResult
Evaluation "1" -- "0..*" Weighted
Plan "1" -- "0..*" Weighted
Weight "1" -- "0..*" Weighted
Criteria "1" -- "0..*" Weighted
Selection "0..1" -- "0..*" Weighted
Evaluation "1" -- "0..*" Flag
Evaluation "1" -- "0..*" AiRun
Evaluation "1" -- "0..*" Review

note bottom of Weight
专业目录固定五维，默认权重20/20/20/20/20；
仅修改权重时复用基础评价，不重新调用AI。
end note

note bottom of Criteria
MUST形成排序层级；PREFER仅取5/10/20且满足时加分；
官方方案全部PREFER合计不超过30；
DISPLAY_ONLY只展示，个人不能关闭官方MUST。
end note

note top of Plan
仅SUPER_ADMIN持有人创建/激活；同一JD仅一个ACTIVE；
变更复制新版本，只影响后续任务，历史评分不重跑。
end note

note bottom of Weighted
基础分、附加分/上限和综合参考分分别保存；
不同方案或不同上限不得无提示直接比较。
end note
@enduml
